    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/ced25ac70954279dc1c922a2dad55ae4.avif?t=1746794566\" data-has-big width=800 height=114 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electrifying music:</strong> Immerse yourself in a cyberpunk universe filled with powerful original mixes of rock, drum and bass, synthwave, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme challenges:</strong> Test your mind and reflexes in levels designed to push you to the limit. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive narrative:</strong> Take a break between battles to follow three antiheroes in a gripping story of inequality, revenge, and revolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glory awaits:</strong> Fight, fall, try again. Become the ultimate Beatlord and climb to the top of the leaderboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/25beb77b4757e3f4a2ccb543efe9f9de.poster.avif?t=1746794566\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/25beb77b4757e3f4a2ccb543efe9f9de.webm?t=1746794566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/25beb77b4757e3f4a2ccb543efe9f9de.mp4?t=1746794566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/c2c0e6ea9930ecfe3afbaad33d9733da.avif?t=1746794566\" data-has-big width=800 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beatlords</strong> immerses you in a dark and ruthless cyberpunk universe where social inequalities and injustices prevail. In this thrilling rhythm game, you'll accompany three unexpected antiheroes\u2014outcasts and underestimated individuals\u2014who decide to take control of their destinies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each rhythm-synced step, you'll forge your path through challenging levels, driven by raw motives: revenge, hatred, or greed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed solely with your skill to master sound synchronization, you'll face a hostile world where every move can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path, feel the rhythm, and prove that even the weakest can change the course of history. <strong>Achieve it... or die trying</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/64eb57d079a7ab8e321c478b67f373bd.poster.avif?t=1746794566\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/64eb57d079a7ab8e321c478b67f373bd.webm?t=1746794566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/64eb57d079a7ab8e321c478b67f373bd.mp4?t=1746794566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/ced25ac70954279dc1c922a2dad55ae4.avif?t=1746794566\" data-has-big width=800 height=114 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electrifying music:</strong> Immerse yourself in a cyberpunk universe filled with powerful original mixes of rock, drum and bass, synthwave, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme challenges:</strong> Test your mind and reflexes in levels designed to push you to the limit. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive narrative:</strong> Take a break between battles to follow three antiheroes in a gripping story of inequality, revenge, and revolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glory awaits:</strong> Fight, fall, try again. Become the ultimate Beatlord and climb to the top of the leaderboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/25beb77b4757e3f4a2ccb543efe9f9de.poster.avif?t=1746794566\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/25beb77b4757e3f4a2ccb543efe9f9de.webm?t=1746794566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/25beb77b4757e3f4a2ccb543efe9f9de.mp4?t=1746794566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/c2c0e6ea9930ecfe3afbaad33d9733da.avif?t=1746794566\" data-has-big width=800 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beatlords</strong> immerses you in a dark and ruthless cyberpunk universe where social inequalities and injustices prevail. In this thrilling rhythm game, you'll accompany three unexpected antiheroes\u2014outcasts and underestimated individuals\u2014who decide to take control of their destinies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each rhythm-synced step, you'll forge your path through challenging levels, driven by raw motives: revenge, hatred, or greed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed solely with your skill to master sound synchronization, you'll face a hostile world where every move can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path, feel the rhythm, and prove that even the weakest can change the course of history. <strong>Achieve it... or die trying</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/64eb57d079a7ab8e321c478b67f373bd.poster.avif?t=1746794566\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/64eb57d079a7ab8e321c478b67f373bd.webm?t=1746794566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604860/extras/64eb57d079a7ab8e321c478b67f373bd.mp4?t=1746794566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In the year 2196, a ruthless cyberpunk universe awaits you. Join three daring antiheroes and face the megacorporations in frantic rhythm battles where every mistake can be fatal. Become the ultimate Beatlord, master the rhythm, and defy the system. Are you ready for the revolution?",
